  "classification": {
    "rootCause": "code-bug",
    "summary": "RareStakingV1.updateMerkleRoot() guarded itself with require(msg.sender != owner() || msg.sender != 0xc2F3...8ddc), a disjunction that is true for every caller, so the attacker installed their own claim root and drained the staking contract's RARE."
